#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:110
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These limits apply to everybody in every channel and private conversation on this server. Somebody who crosses one is silenced for the cooldown, not disconnected."
msgstr "這些限制適用於此伺服器上每個頻道與私人對話中的所有人。超過限制的人會在冷卻時間內被禁言,而不是被斷線。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/flood_protection_dialog.ex:100
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
