#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/address_book.ex:76
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A contact is yours alone: the nickname, the colour you gave it and your own note. Nobody is told you added them, and nothing here reaches the server they see."
msgstr "聯絡人只屬於你自己:暱稱、你為它設定的顏色和你自己的備註。不會有人知道你新增了他們,這裡的任何內容也不會傳到他們所看到的伺服器。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/mentions_dialog.ex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A mention is recorded whenever somebody writes your nickname in a channel you had joined, whether or not the window was open. Opening one takes you to the line in its own conversation."
msgstr "只要有人在你已加入的頻道中寫出你的暱稱,無論視窗是否開啟,都會記錄一則提及。開啟其中一則,會帶你到它所在對話中的那一行。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/components/ui/dialogs/mentions_dialog.ex:66
